        "edit": "Fix malformed binary literals in the 3'b100 and 3'b111 case arms: 3'b100 was 8'b0001_000 (7 bits, value 8) and should be 8'b0001_0000 (16); 3'b111 was 8'b100_0000 (7 bits, value 64) and should be 8'b1000_0000 (128). This corrects the one-hot decoder outputs at cycles 9 and beyond.",
